  "raw_text": "PLAN \"1-Week Deload\"\nTYPE workout\nVISIBILITY public\n\nGOALS\n  GOAL primary strength:\n    name \"Maintain strength and recover\"\n\nPHASES\n  PHASE \"Deload Week\" (1 weeks):\n    WEEK 1:\n      DAY Monday training 40m \"Upper Deload\":\n        warmup:\n          rowing 5m\n        main straight_sets:\n          bench_press 3x5 rpe 6 rest 120 seconds\n          bent_over_row 3x5 rpe 6 rest 120 seconds\n          shoulder_press 2x6 rpe 6 rest 90 seconds\n          face_pull 2x12 rpe 6 rest 60 seconds\n          bicep_curl 2x10 rpe 6 rest 60 seconds\n          tricep_pushdown 2x10 rpe 6 rest 60 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          chest_stretch 5m\n      DAY Tuesday training 35m \"Lower Deload\":\n        warmup:\n          cycling 5m\n        main straight_sets:\n          squat 3x5 rpe 6 rest 150 seconds\n          romanian_deadlift 2x6 rpe 6 rest 150 seconds\n          leg_curl 2x10 rpe 6 rest 90 seconds\n          calf_raise 2x12 rpe 6 rest 60 seconds\n          plank 3x30..45s rpe 6 rest 60 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          hamstring_stretch 5m\n      DAY Wednesday training 30m \"Active Recovery\":\n        warmup:\n          walking 10m\n        main straight_sets:\n          light_rowing 3x6 rpe 5 rest 60 seconds\n          band_face_pull 2x15 rpe 5 rest 45 seconds\n          bird_dog 3x8 rpe 5 rest 30 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          child_pose 5m\n      DAY Thursday training 40m \"Upper Deload 2\":\n        warmup:\n          rowing 5m\n        main straight_sets:\n          incline_press 3x5 rpe 6 rest 120 seconds\n          seated_row 3x6 rpe 6 rest 120 seconds\n          lateral_raise 2x12 rpe 6 rest 60 seconds\n          rear_delt_fly 2x12 rpe 6 rest 60 seconds\n          hammer_curl 2x10 rpe 6 rest 60 seconds\n          tricep_extension 2x10 rpe 6 rest 60 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          shoulder_stretch 5m\n      DAY Friday training 40m \"Lower Deload 2\":\n        warmup:\n          cycling 5m\n        main straight_sets:\n          deadlift 3x3 rpe 6 rest 180 seconds\n          front_squat 2x5 rpe 6 rest 150 seconds\n          hip_thrust 2x8 rpe 6 rest 90 seconds\n          standing_calf_raise 2x12 rpe 6 rest 60 seconds\n          side_plank 3x30..45s rpe 6 rest 60 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          quad_stretch 5m\n      DAY Saturday training 30m \"Conditioning & Mobility\":\n        warmup:\n          jump_rope 5m\n        main straight_sets:\n          sled_unused 1x1 rpe 5 rest 60 seconds\n          walking 10m rpe 5 rest 0 seconds\n          thoracic_mobility 3x6 rpe 5 rest 30 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          spinal_twist 5m\n      DAY Sunday training 20m \"Rest & Recovery\":\n        warmup:\n          walking 10m\n        main straight_sets:\n          diaphragmatic_breathing 5x1m rpe 3 rest 30 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          child_pose 5m",
